  "body": "I have synapse and Element set up on the same server on an internal LAN and was trying to set up a reverse proxy on another  host with real ip.\r\nThe problem I have is that I can authenticate with a user but when I go to write messages to other users it gives me a sending error.\r\nDoing an inspection of the page I have multiple errors with the following message:\r\nError sending room key request; will retry later. ConnectionError: fetch failed: NetworkError when attempting to fetch resource.\r\n\r\nso my question is if it is possible configure a reverse proxy for synapse and element on another host, and How would I do it to avoid errors?",
